# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository and working tree across
# platforms. Python, JSON and Markdown stay LF everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The VBA source inside the conformance corpus is JSON-escaped (\r\n inside
# string literals), so it survives this untouched. Nothing in the repository
# stores VBA as raw CRLF text; the fixtures are built at test time, not
# committed, which is what keeps that true.
